      <item>
          <title>Sunflowers</title>
          <pubDate>Tue, 05 Apr 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
          <author>Kyle Parker Cunningham</author>
          <link>https://kyleparkercunningham.com/oeuvre/printmaking/2022/sunflowers/</link>
          <guid>https://kyleparkercunningham.com/oeuvre/printmaking/2022/sunflowers/</guid>
          <description xml:base="https://kyleparkercunningham.com/oeuvre/printmaking/2022/sunflowers/">&lt;p&gt;Intaglio Drypoint Print.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;versions&quot;&gt;Versions&lt;&#x2F;h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each print is printed in an open ended series.  I physically scratch the print number into the plate before inking it and then print just one copy at that number.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Below are the various prints I&#x27;ve made of this plate:&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;









&lt;figure class=&quot;art-image&quot;&gt;
  &lt;img
    src=&quot;&#x2F;processed_images&amp;#x2F;IMG_3954-1.5b8482fb22e0872c.jpg&quot;
    srcset=&quot;&#x2F;processed_images&amp;#x2F;IMG_3954-1.af5dcb7214917a76.jpg 480w, &#x2F;processed_images&amp;#x2F;IMG_3954-1.5b8482fb22e0872c.jpg 960w, &#x2F;processed_images&amp;#x2F;IMG_3954-1.6fd5e77855e6332d.jpg 1600w&quot;
    sizes=&quot;(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1200px) 80vw, 900px&quot;
    width=&quot;960&quot; height=&quot;720&quot;
    alt=&quot;Intaglio drypoint print of sunflowers in a mug, with a large spiraling flower head in the foreground and several smaller blooms rising above, hand-colored with warm burnt orange on the mug and petals against a scratched gray background.&quot;
    
    loading=&quot;eager&quot; fetchpriority=&quot;high&quot;
    decoding=&quot;async&quot;
  &gt;
  &lt;figcaption&gt;Sunflowers #1 by Kyle Parker Cunningham&lt;&#x2F;figcaption&gt;
&lt;&#x2F;figure&gt;









